id: pm-web-71et
title: "Make the pm-github 2026.10.19 workflow ref bump pass: the Dependabot pin update left the pm-github-version input behind"
description: "Dependabot bumped the canonical pm-github reusable workflow callers to release 2026.10.19 (sha pin and '# pm-github 2026.10.19' release comment) but left the 'pm-github-version' workflow input at 2026.10.16, so the workflow pin policy test fails with 'the workflow release and package version must match'. Move the input to 2026.10.19 so the sha pin, release comment and package input stay consistent as one reviewed pin update."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: "gh:unbraind/pm-web#254","gh:unbraind/pm-web#255"
created_at: "2026-10-26T15:10:49.216Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T11:46:57.982Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T11:46:49.134Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-27T11:07:51.000Z"
author: pi-glm
resolution: "Align both pm-github reusable workflow pins, release comments and package-version inputs with reviewed release 2026.10.19."
expected_result: Both sync and closeout workflow callers use consistent reviewed SHA/comment pins and matching pm-github-version inputs.
actual_result: "Current-main workflow security and update-automation tests pass. Both caller comments and package-version inputs consistently select 2026.10.19, delivered by merged PRs #254 and #255; the latter merge is the actual completion time."
comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T15:11:02.870Z",pi-glm,"Cause: the Dependabot workflow ref bump (2026.10.16 -> 2026.10.19) updated the sha pin and the release comment on both canonical pm-github callers but did not update the 'pm-github-version' reusable workflow input, so the pin policy test fails on 'the workflow release and package version must match' (expected 2026.10.19, actual 2026.10.16). The pinned commit is the pm-github v2026.10.19 release commit, so the bump is a valid reviewed release. Fix: move the 'pm-github-version' input to 2026.10.19 on each bumped caller so pin, comment and package input match. The pin policy itself is unchanged and still enforced."
  "2026-10-26T15:12:25.450Z",pi-glm,"The closeout caller PR got the same fix: the Dependabot bump moved the pm-github-closeout sha pin and release comment to 2026.10.19 while leaving its 'pm-github-version' input at 2026.10.16; the input now matches the pinned 2026.10.19 release. Verified with the same workflow pin policy tests: 8 tests, 8 pass."
  "2026-10-26T18:28:15.570Z",codex-agent,"Continuation: reuse the original shared chore from both workflow bump branches, preserving the closeout branch additional comment. Existing fixes 45e8e3f and 11bede8 align pm-github-version with the immutable 2026.10.19 SHA and release comment; the release tag resolves to 09412243e2543adedbb73a4f4b2f2b6e2ac0c8a6. Source CI matrices 40347026230 and 40347099885 pass on Node 22 and 26. Validate complete local npm and Bun release gates against a dedicated synthetic test database. This existing item remains open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-26T18:45:33.895Z",codex-agent,"Local complete npm gate reached a large-corpus graph latency failure after roughly 70.8 seconds under shared host load. This is outside the workflow-only source delta and aligns with existing timing follow-up pm-web-hqqp. Preserve the configured bound and all assertions. Both workflow policy variants passed 8/8, and the pre-continuation application source already passed both hosted CI matrices. The full local run is still completing; no local full-gate pass is claimed."
  "2026-10-26T18:46:04.142Z",codex-agent,"Timing detail: 70805 ms is the whole graph test duration. Its measured read was 16927 ms wall and 3406 ms CPU, with 20942 involuntary context switches, against the unchanged 10000 ms read limit. Added this exact evidence to existing follow-up pm-web-hqqp."
  "2026-10-26T19:14:43.520Z",codex-agent,"Complete local npm gate finished 830 tests: 823 pass, 6 fail, 1 cancellation, zero skips. Known graph timing evidence is on pm-web-hqqp. Catalog deadline/cascading ENOTDIR and production-child startup failures are recorded on existing pm-web-qdhx. Privacy assertion was not reached because its server did not start within deadline, so no privacy acceptance is claimed. Configured coverage is also unaccepted. Both workflow policy variants still pass 8/8. Bun gate now runs against the same dedicated synthetic database; no authored source, deadline, assertion or policy changes were made."
  "2026-10-26T19:27:56.560Z",codex-agent,"Verified tracked application, build, test, dependency and package files are identical across the two workflow bump branch heads. Differences are confined to the two canonical workflow callers and PM records; generated changelog refresh is separate. Thus the per-repository runtime gates cover the shared application source, while both variants independently pass their 8-test policy suite. Each final branch still requires its own exact-head CI result."
  "2026-10-26T20:02:37.517Z",codex-agent,"Complete Bun coverage run finished 830 tests: 827 pass, 2 fail, 1 cancellation, zero skips. Built catalog acceptance again hit its unchanged 300000 ms deadline; subsequent source case reported ENOTDIR. The graph read measured 29175 ms wall against 10000 ms. Other npm startup failures passed in Bun, including actual SSE and privacy-log checks. Full configured coverage remains unaccepted, and both runs are preserved on pm-web-qdhx and pm-web-hqqp. Remaining release commands now run separately; the workflow-only fix still passes both policy variants 8/8."
  "2026-10-26T20:11:15.141Z",codex-agent,"All remaining release commands passed separately: npm run accept:capacity, audit:prod, pack:dry-run, accept:packed, changelog:check, verify:release-changelog-date and verify:release-publish-attestation. These receipts do not replace failed full npm/Bun coverage runs: 823/830 plus 6 failures and 1 cancellation in npm; 827/830 plus 2 failures and 1 cancellation in Bun. Both policy variants pass 8/8 on identical application/test source. Final commits preserve the immutable workflow SHA/release/package alignment, refresh generated release history and carry this shared item plus existing timing follow-ups. Release the claim for orchestrator verification without closing any item."
  "2026-10-26T20:46:15.759Z",codex-agent,"Both final CI matrices passed runtime, configured coverage, capacity, audit and package stages, then failed only changelog:check. The complete generated diff is the leading heading: committed 2026.10.25 versus expected Unreleased. CI validates the PR merge snapshot with current main package 2026.10.26; the older Dependabot head is package 2026.10.24. A local release-history migration on that older head incorrectly changed the heading that current main needs. Reproduce generation in the actual GitHub merge snapshot and apply only its generated heading correction to each existing branch; preserve the workflow policy and all tests."
  "2026-10-26T20:55:09.443Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced against the actual GitHub PR merge snapshot with its pinned dependencies installed: changelog:full generated exactly one changed heading, from 2026.10.25 to Unreleased, and changelog:check then passed. Applied that generated hunk to both workflow branches, preserving the original release-history ownership instead of migrating history using their stale package version. All four failed CI jobs had the same heading-only diff after earlier gate stages passed. This is an artifact-context correction; the immutable pins, release comments, matching package inputs, test code, coverage thresholds and deadlines remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-27T11:45:40.509Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: Both halves are now delivered on current main: PR #254 merged 24401b8f7bf1a4e685b7b36e3901d2d60f894cc8 at 2026-10-27T01:03:06Z for sync, and PR #255 merged b83bf070bd622a55a0a7e925d00124e29e23c651 at 2026-10-27T11:07:51Z for closeout. Inspected both caller SHA pins, reviewed-release comments and pm-github-version inputs: all reference 2026.10.19. The combined item stayed nonterminal while #255 was open; closure now uses the final delivery timestamp from #255. Both policy test files verify caller security and coordinated version updates. Delivered by PR #255, merge commit b83bf070bd622a55a0a7e925d00124e29e23c651, merged_at 2026-10-27T11:07:51Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T11:46:40.896Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main with `node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/workflow-security.test.ts test/workflow-update-automation.test.ts` via the pinned pm linked runner: PASS. Observed test counts: tests=8, pass=8, fail=0, cancelled=0, skipped=0, todo=0. Current-main workflow security and update-automation tests pass. Both caller comments and package-version inputs consistently select 2026.10.19, delivered by merged PRs #254 and #255; the latter merge is the actual completion time."
